# Architectural Decision Records

Use this folder for consequential decisions that need explicit rationale, considered alternatives, and consequences: choices that would be materially different under a different outcome, that cross module/system boundaries, or that are hard to reverse once implementation begins.

Lighter, easily-reversible decisions belong in [../../decisions/](../../decisions/) instead.

